{"2769570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fable", "steam_appid": 2769570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Premium Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/3454b874f22843508b85a9faf0c0c998.avif?t=1787859126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras_big/3454b874f22843508b85a9faf0c0c998.avif?t=1787859126 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>PC Hardware Requirements</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/ab39900d2f7ce824b7a9767c9b215066.avif?t=1787859126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras_big/ab39900d2f7ce824b7a9767c9b215066.avif?t=1787859126 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-order Fable now to receive the Pre-Order Content Pack, featuring the questionably heroic <strong>Chicken Suit</strong> and a collection of charming in-game Gifts: a <strong>Wild Flower Bouquet</strong>, a <strong>Toy Chicken</strong>, and a <strong>Scones &amp; Jam Picnic Hamper</strong>. Use them to build your reputation and shape how Albion sees your Hero.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the Hero you want to be in an immersive open-world action-RPG where each choice shapes your journey, reputation is everything, and fairytale endings are never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/4dd880b55a87b37ff88049e3c24d0689.avif?t=1787859126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras_big/4dd880b55a87b37ff88049e3c24d0689.webp?t=1787859126 width=1560 height=185 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/8fe9422c387716589a57a870b90d47f6.poster.avif?t=1787859126\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/8fe9422c387716589a57a870b90d47f6.webm?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/8fe9422c387716589a57a870b90d47f6.mp4?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fable returns in a stunning reboot of a beloved franchise. As the first Hero in a generation, explore a living Albion filled with peculiar characters, dark humour, and chickens... lots of chickens. This isn’t just nostalgia — it’s a new beginning set in a beautifully vibrant open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/5401a0e560da8878e07a9f1ba53c93fa.avif?t=1787859126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras_big/5401a0e560da8878e07a9f1ba53c93fa.webp?t=1787859126 width=1560 height=185 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/79b0b2a373096f66bcec9a6d789147ac.poster.avif?t=1787859126\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/79b0b2a373096f66bcec9a6d789147ac.webm?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/79b0b2a373096f66bcec9a6d789147ac.mp4?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Hero’s appearance and wield powerful weapons as you weave melee, ranged, and magical combat. Take on bandits, beasts, and creatures — including brand-new enemies and fan-favorites like Hobbes, Balverines, and Trolls. Your power grows right alongside your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/61fedffdf0980607d465dc1dad147771.avif?t=1787859126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras_big/61fedffdf0980607d465dc1dad147771.webp?t=1787859126 width=1560 height=185 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/f28477d2eaea5d2bb418d6814b98455f.poster.avif?t=1787859126\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/f28477d2eaea5d2bb418d6814b98455f.webm?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/f28477d2eaea5d2bb418d6814b98455f.mp4?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond all the combat lies a living world where you can carve your own identity. Get filthy rich as a landlord or blacksmith, romance a villager (or three), have a bunch of kids, and watch as your reputation precedes you. Being a Hero is a bit like being a celebrity… if celebrities carried swords and occasionally battled giant fire-breathing chickens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/852b3b83380c4f6ecdb1fa37d112e7e7.avif?t=1787859126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras_big/852b3b83380c4f6ecdb1fa37d112e7e7.webp?t=1787859126 width=1560 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/9db6963592cfa3c29c663e24e7f0b8a3.poster.avif?t=1787859126\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/9db6963592cfa3c29c663e24e7f0b8a3.webm?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/9db6963592cfa3c29c663e24e7f0b8a3.mp4?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Albion, a Hero’s reputation is everything. Your noble deeds and questionable decisions affect your relationship with each villager and can even shape the world around you. Whose opinion matters most? The choice is yours… and so are the consequences. It’s up to you to decide what it means to be a Hero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fairytale Ending Not Guaranteed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fable unleashes the power and flexibility of the PC platform with high uncapped framerates. Experience 4K visuals supported by NVIDIA DLSS, and AMD FSR**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Pre-order offer ends at official game launch date. Limit 1 per person/account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Features require compatible PC. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-order Fable now to receive the Pre-Order Content Pack, featuring the questionably heroic <strong>Chicken Suit</strong> and a collection of charming in-game Gifts: a <strong>Wild Flower Bouquet</strong>, a <strong>Toy Chicken</strong>, and a <strong>Scones &amp; Jam Picnic Hamper</strong>. Use them to build your reputation and shape how Albion sees your Hero.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the Hero you want to be in an immersive open-world action-RPG where each choice shapes your journey, reputation is everything, and fairytale endings are never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/4dd880b55a87b37ff88049e3c24d0689.avif?t=1787859126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras_big/4dd880b55a87b37ff88049e3c24d0689.webp?t=1787859126 width=1560 height=185 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/8fe9422c387716589a57a870b90d47f6.poster.avif?t=1787859126\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/8fe9422c387716589a57a870b90d47f6.webm?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769570/extras/8fe9422c387716589a57a870b90d47f6.mp4?t=1787859126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fable returns in a stunning reboot of a beloved franchise. As the first Hero in a generation, explore a living Albion filled with peculiar characters, dark humour, and chickens... lots of chickens. This isn’t just nostalgia — it’s a new begin